# Keep every text file LF in the index and in the working tree, on every
# platform. A CRLF checkout breaks the shell script and the Python script
# outright: the shebang line becomes `/usr/bin/env bash\r` and neither is
# executable. Editors that save CRLF are handled by this, not by the author.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
